# Cloudflare Pages SPA proxies for the Admin app. Each admitted route serves the root app entry
# with HTTP 200 so a direct link or reload keeps the requested browser URL for React Router.
# Both exact path forms are explicit. The four existing splats retain deep editor and detail URLs.
# A top-level 404.html disables Pages' implicit all-path SPA fallback, so a missing asset or path
# outside these prefixes cannot receive the Admin shell. A path under one of the four retained
# splats still boots the app and can render its client-side Not found view. Static rules stay
# before dynamic splats as Pages requires.
